rnalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-13T14:32:25","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"dab41934-944f-4b2a-aa3e-6dadc46f1315","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561313648,"PostDateInt":1791854750000,"PostDate":"2026-10-13T09:25:50","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级软件工程师(J11606)","OrgId":2103133,"Org":"装备固件组","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·中山市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 负责闪存测试装备/自动化测试平台嵌入式软件设计与开发。\n2. 负责 PCIe/NVMe、UFS、NAND 驱动、协议栈、固件及底层接口开发调试。\n3. 负责嵌入式 Linux 内核、驱动、用户态工具开发。\n4. 负责 MCU/RTOS 实时控制、时序/采集、测试调度、存储驱动开发。\n5. 依据 JEDEC、AEC-Q100 及 NAND/FTL 原理，制定测试方案并设计故障注入用例。\n6. 协同跨团队完成装备需求到量产闭环；具备 ATE/测试板卡/协议分析经验优先。\n7. 指导初级工程师，参与技术评审与关键问题攻关。","Require":"1. 电子/计算机/微电子/自动化等本科及以上。\n2. 精通 C/C++，嵌入式开发扎实。\n3. 熟悉嵌入式 Linux 驱动（内核、设备树、中断、DMA、PCIe/UFS）。\n4. 熟悉 PCIe/NVMe 或 UFS/UniPro/M-PHY，有驱动/固件/测试装备经验优先。\n5. 熟悉 MCU/RTOS（FreeRTOS/Zephyr/RT-Thread/ThreadX），有实时调试经验。\n6.了解 JEDEC、AEC-Q100 及 NAND/FTL 原理（映射、磨损均衡、GC、坏块、ECC、掉电恢复）。\n7. 有测试装备/自动化测试/仪器控制/协议分析经验，能使用示波器、逻辑分析仪、协议分析仪定位问题。","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-13T09:25:50","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"4d01d3f2-344e-4021-8500-0a12999a9566","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561306835,"PostDateInt":1789608561000,"PostDate":"2026-09-17T09:29:21","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"采购主管(J11328)","OrgId":2875025,"Org":"器件采购部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"20K-25K 元/月","Duty":"1、采购数据统筹与处理：负责采购数据整理、清洗、统计与分析，涵盖物料采购数据、库存数据、到货数据、成本数据、供应商履约数据等，建立标准化数据台账，保障采购数据的准确性、完整性和时效性，为采购决策、物料调度、成本管控提供核心数据支撑。\n2、物料计划统筹支持：依托物料计划相关工作经验，协助完成物料需求测算、采购计划拆解、库存周转分析、物料备货节奏把控等工作。结合生产、仓储、销售需求，联动梳理物料供需情况，预判物料短缺、积压风险，优化物料采购及库存计划，保障供应链物料稳定供应。\n3、成本核算分析与管控：熟悉采购物料成本结构，精通标准成本计算逻辑，负责各类物料采购成本核算、成本拆解、价差分析及成本复盘工作。精准核算物料采购单价、综合成本，梳理成本构成明细，识别成本浪费、溢价点位，输出成本优化方向，为采购降本、成本管控、报价核算提供精准数据支撑。\n4、各类汇报报告撰写：负责撰写采购部门各类日常、月度、季度、年度汇报报告，包含采购数据分析报告、物料计划复盘报告、供应链风险报告、成本核算分析报告、降本专项报告、部门工作总结及工作计划等。能够结合成本数据、物料数据、采购数据深度洞察业务问题、提炼工作亮点、输出可行性降本及优化建议，为部门管理及管理层决策提供完整、专业的书面汇报材料。\n5、完成领导交办的其他采购数据统计、成本核算分析、物料统筹及专项汇报工作。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，3年及以上电子制造业采购成本分析、物料核价、供应链成本管控相关经验，熟悉PCB、元器件、结构件等物料成本结构者优先。\n2、精通Should Cost Model（标准成本模型），具备扎实的物料成本拆解、建模、测算能力，熟悉制造业物料成本构成及生产工艺逻辑，可独立搭建、迭代各类物料成本模型。\n3、熟练掌握数据分析工具，精通PBI、ACCESS数据库，能够独立完成数据清洗、多维度数据建模、可视化报表制作、数据联动分析；掌握Python基础数据分析能力，可通过脚本批量处理数据、自动化统计分析、优化工作效率。\n4、具备极强的数据敏感度、逻辑分析能力，能够精准识别成本漏洞、报价异常，具备独立核价、议价及项目降本落地能力。\n5、熟悉采购流程、供应商管理体系，具备电子行业供应链行情认知，有新品成本评估、存量物料降本、供应商价格谈判实战经验。\n6、工作严谨细致、责任心强，具备良好的跨部门沟通能力、问题解决能力及项目推进能力，抗压性强，可落地各项成本管控指标。","ClassificationOne":"职能","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-17T09:29:21","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"678fd4c0-2098-4038-af90-1d7dfb4c1447","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561306815,"PostDateInt":1789608032000,"PostDate":"2026-09-17T09:20:32","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"设备采购经理(J11564)","OrgId":2875024,"Org":"设备采购部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市·浦东新区"],"Salary":"18K-28K 元/月